---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SquiggleDivider from '../components/SquiggleDivider.astro';
---
<Base
  title="About — Purl Pressure"
  description="Mallory Iversen — knitter, neuro-spicy engineer, color obsessive. The story behind Purl Pressure."
>
  <header class="hero">
    <div class="pp-container hero__inner">
      <div class="hero__copy">
        <p class="hero__byline">Curated by Mallory</p>
        <h1 class="pp-display pp-display--lg hero__title">
          I knit because I need to <em>feel something.</em>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero__lede">
          The knitting internet still has a beige problem — same five patterns, same five neutrals, every week. I got bored and started posting what I actually loved. Turns out a lot of people were bored too. Purl Pressure is where that goes now: Weekly Obsessions, color tools, and more in the works.
        </p>
      </div>

      <aside class="hero__card" aria-label="At a glance">
        <p class="pp-eyebrow">At a glance</p>
        <ul class="hero__facts">
          <li><span>Based in</span><strong>Iowa</strong></li>
          <li><span>Color season</span><strong>True Summer (Cool)</strong></li>
          <li><span>Needles</span><strong>Whatever gets the job done</strong></li>
          <li><span>Currently</span><strong>Too many WIPs, zero regrets</strong></li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="pp-section story">
    <div class="pp-container">

      <div class="story__block">
        <h2 class="story__h">It started as a portfolio.<br/>It became a lifeline.</h2>
        <p class="story__p">
          I wanted to test knit for designers and needed something to show I was real. Then my chronic illness got worse and I found myself home more than I&rsquo;d planned. Purl Pressure stopped being a side project and started being the thing that kept me sane. Community, creativity, a reason to keep going. I&rsquo;m neuro-spicy and I need to be doing something that makes me feel something or I will absolutely climb the walls.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="story__block">
        <h2 class="story__h">Trendy, but make it<br/>last.</h2>
        <p class="story__p">
          My taste is all over the place and I&rsquo;m not sorry about it. Dynamic, eclectic, a little charismatic — I want things that feel current and things I know will still be right in five years. Sometimes that&rsquo;s the same thing. I pay attention to trends because I genuinely love watching them happen, and I&rsquo;m good at knowing which moments are worth more than a season. If I&rsquo;m putting it in front of you, it passed that test.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="story__block">
        <h2 class="story__h">I build things when nothing else <em>fits.</em></h2>
        <p class="story__p">
          I&rsquo;m an engineer by trade and that brain doesn&rsquo;t quiet down just because I&rsquo;m holding yarn. There&rsquo;s a tool in the works. More soon.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <SquiggleDivider />

  <section class="pp-section reach">
    <div class="pp-container reach__inner">
      <h2 class="pp-display pp-display--md reach__h">
        Say <em>hi.</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="reach__sub">
        DMs are open on Instagram. Tag me if you knit something I obsessed over. That&rsquo;s the whole point.
      </p>
      <div class="reach__cta">
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/purlpressure/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="pp-btn pp-btn--accent">
          @purlpressure on Instagram &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: var(--pp-16) 0 var(--pp-12);
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 30%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--pp-rose) 14%, transparent), transparent 60%),
      var(--pp-bg);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--pp-border-soft);
  }

  .hero__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--pp-10);
  }

  @media (min-width: 980px) {
    .hero__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
      gap: var(--pp-16);
      align-items: center;
    }
  }

  .hero__byline {
    font-family: var(--pp-font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--pp-text-muted);
    margin: 0 0 var(--pp-5);
  }
  .hero__title { margin: 0 0 var(--pp-6); }
  .hero__title em { color: var(--pp-rose); font-style: italic; }

  .hero__lede {
    font-size: clamp(18px, 1.6vw, 22px);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--pp-text-soft);
    max-width: 56ch;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .hero__card {
    padding: var(--pp-6);
    background: var(--pp-bg-elevated);
    border: 1px solid var(--pp-border-soft);
    border-radius: var(--pp-radius-md);
    transform: rotate(1.5deg);
    transition: transform 220ms var(--pp-ease);
  }

  .hero__card:hover { transform: rotate(0); }

  .hero__facts {
    list-style: none;
    margin: var(--pp-3) 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--pp-3);
  }

  .hero__facts li {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--pp-3);
    padding-bottom: var(--pp-3);
    border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--pp-border-soft);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .hero__facts li:last-child { border-bottom: 0; padding-bottom: 0; }

  .hero__facts span { color: var(--pp-text-muted); font-family: var(--pp-font-mono); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .hero__facts strong { color: var(--pp-text); font-weight: 600; text-align: right; }

  /* Story */
  .story__block {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--pp-5);
    max-width: 720px;
    padding-bottom: var(--pp-12);
    margin-bottom: var(--pp-12);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--pp-border-soft);
  }

  .story__block:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .story__block {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: var(--pp-10);
      align-items: start;
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }

  .story__h {
    font-family: var(--pp-font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 44px);
    line-height: 1.0;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--pp-text);
  }

  .story__p {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--pp-text-soft);
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 54ch;
  }

  .story__h em { color: var(--pp-terracotta); font-style: italic; }

  /* Reach */
  .reach__inner { text-align: center; }
  .reach__h { margin: 0 0 var(--pp-4); color: var(--pp-text); }
  .reach__h em { color: var(--pp-clary-sage); font-style: italic; }
  .reach__sub { color: var(--pp-text-soft); max-width: 48ch; margin: 0 auto var(--pp-6); }
  .reach__cta { display: flex; justify-content: center; }
</style>
